Package: wrangler
Version: 4.123.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Twilight <twilight@aliveos.org>
Depends: nodejs-lts | nodejs
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/wrangler/
Description: Cloudflare Workers CLI
 Cloudflare Workers command-line tooling. Cloud API commands only
 (deploy, tail, pages, r2, kv, etc). Local dev server (wrangler dev)
 is not supported on Termux as workerd does not ship Android binaries.
